{"step_index":47,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-30T13:51:11Z","input_tokens":3193,"cache_read_tokens":59721,"output_tokens":5581,"thinking":"A strong Random Forest model significantly outperforms linear regression, as indicated by the R-squared values and saved performance metrics. The operational database is initialized and ready. The next step involves designing and developing the frontend components, including stylesheets, JavaScript for dashboard functionality, charting, and simulation, alongside the HTML template.\n\n\nVerified UI requirements to inform the initial stylesheet design. Focused on creating a modern aesthetic suitable for a premier medical software suite, considering typography, color palettes, and component styles for the stylesheet. The immediate task is to develop the `style.css` file to establish the core visual foundation.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"/* ============================================================\n   QUEUE ORACLE - Hospital Queue & Resource Prediction System\n   Primary Styling: Professional Medical Tech Dashboard\n   Palette: Clean white & light blue background, dark navy sidebar\n   ============================================================ */\n\n:root {\n    --bg-main: #f4f8fb;\n    --bg-card: #ffffff;\n    --navy-dark: #0b1a30;\n    --navy-sidebar: #10243e;\n    --navy-sidebar-hover: #1b3558;\n    --navy-active: #1976d2;\n    --text-primary: #1e293b;\n    --text-secondary: #64748b;\n    --text-muted: #94a3b8;\n    --primary-blue: #0284c7;\n    --primary-light: #e0f2fe;\n    --accent-cyan: #06b6d4;\n    \n    /* Medical Status Colors */\n    --status-normal: #10b981;\n    --status-normal-bg: #ecfdf5;\n    --status-warning: #f59e0b;\n    --status-warning-bg: #fffbeb;\n    --status-critical: #ef4444;\n    --status-critical-bg: #fef2f2;\n    \n    --border-color: #e2e8f0;\n    --shadow-sm: 0 1px 3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\n    --shadow-md: 0 4px 12px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.07);\n    --radius-md: 10px;\n    --radius-lg: 14px;\n}\n\nbody {\n    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    background-color: var(--bg-main);\n    color: var(--text-primary);\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    overflow-x: hidden;\n}\n\n/* ---------------- Layout & Sidebar ---------------- */\n#app-container {\n    display: flex;\n    min-height: 100vh;\n}\n\n#sidebar {\n    width: 270px;\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--navy-dark) 0%, var(--navy-sidebar) 100%);\n    color: #ffffff;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n    position: fixed;\n    top: 0;\n    bottom: 0;\n    left: 0;\n    z-index: 1000;\n    overflow-y: auto;\n    border-right: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);\n}\n\n#sidebar::-webkit-scrollbar {\n    width: 5px;\n}\n#sidebar::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);\n    border-radius: 4px;\n}\n\n.brand-section {\n    padding: 1.25rem 1.25rem;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);\n}\n\n.brand-title {\n    font-size: 1.15rem;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n    color: #38bdf8;\n    margin: 0;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 0.6rem;\n}\n\n.brand-subtitle {\n    font-size: 0.72rem;\n    color: var(--text-muted);\n    margin-top: 0.2rem;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    letter-spacing: 0.8px;\n}\n\n.sidebar-nav {\n    list-style: none;\n    padding: 0.75rem 0.6rem;\n    margin: 0;\n    flex-grow: 1;\n}\n\n.sidebar-nav .nav-header {\n    font-size: 0.68rem;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: #64748b;\n    padding: 0.6rem 0.8rem 0.3rem;\n    letter-spacing: 0.6px;\n}\n\n.sidebar-nav .nav-link {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 0.75rem;\n    padding: 0.55rem 0.85rem;\n    color: #cbd5e1;\n    font-size: 0.86rem;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    transition: all 0.2s ease;\n    margin-bottom: 0.2rem;\n    cursor: pointer;\n}\n\n.sidebar-nav .nav-link:hover {\n    background-color: var(--navy-sidebar-hover);\n    color: #ffffff;\n    transform: translateX(3px);\n}\n\n.sidebar-nav .nav-link.active {\n    background-color: var(--navy-active);\n    color: #ffffff;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.35);\n}\n\n.sidebar-nav .nav-link i {\n    width: 18px;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 0.95rem;\n}\n\n.sidebar-nav .nav-badge {\n    margin-left: auto;\n    font-size: 0.7rem;\n    padding: 0.15rem 0.45rem;\n    border-radius: 12px;\n}\n\n.sidebar-footer {\n    padding: 1rem;\n    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);\n    font-size: 0.75rem;\n    color: var(--text-muted);\n    background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);\n}\n\n/* ---------------- Main Content Area ---------------- */\n#main-content {\n    margin-left: 270px;\n    flex-grow: 1;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    min-height: 100vh;\n}\n\n.top-navbar {\n    background-color: #ffffff;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n    padding: 0.75rem 1.75rem;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    position: sticky;\n    top: 0;\n    z-index: 900;\n}\n\n.page-container {\n    padding: 1.5rem 1.75rem;\n    flex-grow: 1;\n}\n\n/* ---------------- Section Toggle ---------------- */\n.dashboard-section {\n    display: none;\n    animation: fadeIn 0.25s ease-in-out;\n}\n\n.dashboard-section.active {\n    display: block;\n}\n\n@keyframes fadeIn {\n    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(4px); }\n    to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }\n}\n\n/* ---------------- Cards & Widgets ---------------- */\n.card-widget {\n    background-color: var(--bg-card);\n    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);\n    padding: 1.25rem;\n    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;\n    transition: box-shadow 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;\n}\n\n.card-widget:hover {\n    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);\n}\n\n.widget-header {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    margin-bottom: 1rem;\n    padding-bottom: 0.6rem;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9;\n}\n\n.widget-title {\n    font-size: 1rem;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: var(--navy-dark);\n    margin: 0;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 0.5rem;\n}\n\n.widget-title i {\n    color: var(--primary-blue);\n}\n\n/* ---------------- Stat Cards ---------------- */\n.stat-card {\n    background-color: #ffffff;\n    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n    padding: 1.15rem 1.25rem;\n    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    position: relative;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    margin-bottom: 1rem;\n}\n\n.stat-card::before {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0;\n    top: 0;\n    bottom: 0;\n    width: 4px;\n}\n\n.stat-card.blue::before { background-color: var(--primary-blue); }\n.stat-card.green::before { background-color: var(--status-normal); }\n.stat-card.yellow::before { background-color: var(--status-warning); }\n.stat-card.red::before { background-color: var(--status-critical); }\n.stat-card.cyan::before { background-color: var(--accent-cyan); }\n\n.stat-info .stat-label {\n    font-size: 0.78rem;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    color: var(--text-secondary);\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;\n}\n\n.stat-info .stat-value {\n    font-size: 1.65rem;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    color: var(--navy-dark);\n    line-height: 1.1;\n}\n\n.stat-info .stat-sub {\n    font-size: 0.72rem;\n    color: var(--text-muted);\n    margin-top: 0.3rem;\n}\n\n.stat-icon {\n    width: 46px;\n    height: 46px;\n    border-radius: 12px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 1.3rem;\n}\n\n.stat-icon.blue { background-color: var(--primary-light); color: var(--primary-blue); }\n.stat-icon.green { background-color: var(--status-normal-bg); color: var(--status-normal); }\n.stat-icon.yellow { background-color: var(--status-warning-bg); color: var(--status-warning); }\n.stat-icon.red { background-color: var(--status-critical-bg); color: var(--status-critical); }\n.stat-icon.cyan { background-color: #cffafe; color: #0891b2; }\n\n/* ---------------- Status Badges ---------------- */\n.badge-status {\n    padding: 0.3rem 0.65rem;\n    font-size: 0.72rem;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 0.3rem;\n    letter-spacing: 0.3px;\n}\n\n.badge-normal, .badge-NORMAL, .badge-success {\n    background-color: var(--status-normal-bg);\n    color: #065f46;\n    border: 1px solid #a7f3d0;\n}\n\n.badge-warning, .badge-WARNING, .badge-MODERATE {\n    background-color: var(--status-warning-bg);\n    color: #92400e;\n    border: 1px solid #fde68a;\n}\n\n.badge-critical, .badge-CRITICAL, .badge-OVERLOADED, .badge-danger {\n    background-color: var(--status-critical-bg);\n    color: #991b1b;\n    border: 1px solid #fecaca;\n}\n\n.badge-info {\n    background-color: #f0f9ff;\n    color: #0369a1;\n    border: 1px solid #bae6fd;\n}\n\n/* ---------------- Professional Tables ---------------- */\n.table-custom {\n    width: 100%;\n    margin-bottom: 0;\n    border-collapse: separate;\n    border-spacing: 0;\n}\n\n.table-custom th {\n    background-color: #f8fafc;\n    color: var(--text-secondary);\n    font-size: 0.75rem;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;\n    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n    vertical-align: middle;\n}\n\n.table-custom td {\n    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;\n    font-size: 0.85rem;\n    color: var(--text-primary);\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n}\n\n.table-custom tbody tr:hover {\n    background-color: #f8fafc;\n}\n\n/* ---------------- Priority Indicators ---------------- */\n.priority-pill {\n    padding: 0.2rem 0.5rem;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    font-size: 0.72rem;\n    font-weight: 700;\n}\n.priority-emergency { background-color: #fee2e2; color: #b91c1c; border-left: 3px solid #dc2626; }\n.priority-medium { background-color: #fef3c7; color: #b45309; border-left: 3px solid #f59e0b; }\n.priority-normal { background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #475569; border-left: 3px solid #94a3b8; }\n\n/* ---------------- Buttons & Controls ---------------- */\n.btn-oracle {\n    font-size: 0.82rem;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    padding: 0.45rem 0.85rem;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    transition: all 0.2s ease;\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 0.4rem;\n}\n\n.btn-oracle-primary {\n    background-color: var(--primary-blue);\n    color: #ffffff;\n    border: none;\n}\n.btn-oracle-primary:hover {\n    background-color: #0369a1;\n    color: #ffffff;\n}\n\n.btn-oracle-success {\n    background-color: #10b981;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    border: none;\n}\n.btn-oracle-success:hover {\n    background-color: #059669;\n    color: #ffffff;\n}\n\n.btn-oracle-danger {\n    background-color: #ef4444;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    border: none;\n}\n.btn-oracle-danger:hover {\n    background-color: #dc2626;\n    color: #ffffff;\n}\n\n.btn-oracle-warning {\n    background-color: #f59e0b;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    border: none;\n}\n.btn-oracle-warning:hover {\n    background-color: #d97706;\n    color: #ffffff;\n}\n\n/* ---------------- Token Pill ---------------- */\n.token-badge {\n    background: #0f172a;\n    color: #38bdf8;\n    padding: 0.25rem 0.55rem;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    font-family: monospace;\n    font-size: 0.9rem;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    display: inline-block;\n}\n\n/* ---------------- Simulation Floating / Banner ---------------- */\n.sim-indicator {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 0.4rem;\n    padding: 0.35rem 0.75rem;\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    background-color: #fef3c7;\n    border: 1px solid #fde68a;\n    color: #92400e;\n    font-size: 0.75rem;\n    font-weight: 600;\n}\n\n.sim-indicator .dot {\n    width: 8px;\n    height: 8px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background-color: #f59e0b;\n    animation: pulse 1.5s infinite;\n}\n\n@keyframes pulse {\n    0% { transform: scale(0.95); opacity: 0.8; }\n    50% { transform: scale(1.2); opacity: 1; }\n    100% { transform: scale(0.95); opacity: 0.8; }\n}\n\n/* ---------------- Toast Notification ---------------- */\n#toast-container {\n    position: fixed;\n    bottom: 1.5rem;\n    right: 1.5rem;\n    z-index: 9999;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 0.5rem;\n}\n\n.oracle-toast {\n    background: #ffffff;\n    border-left: 4px solid var(--primary-blue);\n    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.15);\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    padding: 0.85rem 1.15rem;\n    min-width: 280px;\n    max-width: 400px;\n    font-size: 0.85rem;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 0.75rem;\n    animation: slideInRight 0.3s ease;\n}\n\n.oracle-toast.success { border-left-color: var(--status-normal); }\n.oracle-toast.danger { border-left-color: var(--status-critical); }\n.oracle-toast.warning { border-left-color: var(--status-warning); }\n\n@keyframes slideInRight {\n    from { transform: translateX(100%); opacity: 0; }\n    to { transform: translateX(0); opacity: 1; }\n}\n\n/* ---------------- Responsive ---------------- */\n@media (max-width: 992px) {\n    #sidebar {\n        width: 70px;\n    }\n    #sidebar .brand-title span,\n    #sidebar .brand-subtitle,\n    #sidebar .nav-header,\n    #sidebar .nav-link span,\n    #sidebar .nav-badge,\n    #sidebar .sidebar-footer {\n        display: none;\n    }\n    #sidebar .nav-link {\n        justify-content: center;\n        padding: 0.75rem 0;\n    }\n    #main-content {\n        margin-left: 70px;\n    }\n}\n","Path":"C:\\Users\\KRUTIKA SHIVANAND\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\queue-oracle\\static\\css\\style.css"}}]}
