{"step_index":51,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-30T13:52:24Z","input_tokens":3127,"cache_read_tokens":68535,"output_tokens":12647,"thinking":"Analyzing the functionality of `static/js/dashboard.js`, which manages navigation across fourteen views. This file also appears to contain a toast notification system, a live clock with auto-refresh, and module-specific data loading (e.g., `loadOverview()` for KPI updates).\n\n\nThe application presents several distinct data views: patient management, doctor queues, prediction explainability, doctor workload, resource forecasts, bed occupancy, disease trends, inventory, workload recommendations, administrator insights, ML performance, and an about section. Each view seems to fetch specific data and render associated visualizations, potentially through a charting library, and has interactive elements for user actions. Data loading strategies involve API calls, particularly for forecasts and predictions.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"/**\n * QUEUE ORACLE - Dashboard Logic & API Integration\n * Manages all 14 navigation sections, live updates, and interactive workflows.\n */\n\n// Global State\nconst OracleState = {\n    currentSection: \"overview\",\n    overviewData: null,\n    doctors: [],\n    patients: [],\n    beds: null,\n    diseaseData: null,\n    inventoryData: null,\n    recommendations: [],\n    autoRefreshInterval: null\n};\n\n// UI Notification Toast\nfunction showToast(message, type = \"info\") {\n    const container = document.getElementById(\"toast-container\");\n    if (!container) return;\n\n    const toast = document.createElement(\"div\");\n    toast.className = `oracle-toast ${type}`;\n    let icon = \"fa-info-circle text-primary\";\n    if (type === \"success\") icon = \"fa-check-circle text-success\";\n    if (type === \"danger\") icon = \"fa-exclamation-triangle text-danger\";\n    if (type === \"warning\") icon = \"fa-exclamation-circle text-warning\";\n\n    toast.innerHTML = `\n        <i class=\"fas ${icon} fa-lg\"></i>\n        <div class=\"flex-grow-1\">${message}</div>\n    `;\n    container.appendChild(toast);\n\n    setTimeout(() => {\n        toast.style.opacity = \"0\";\n        toast.style.transform = \"translateX(100%)\";\n        setTimeout(() => toast.remove(), 300);\n    }, 4000);\n}\n\n// Navigation Handler\nfunction navigateTo(sectionId) {\n    OracleState.currentSection = sectionId;\n\n    // Update sidebar active class\n    document.querySelectorAll(\".sidebar-nav .nav-link\").forEach(link => {\n        if (link.dataset.section === sectionId) {\n            link.classList.add(\"active\");\n        } else {\n            link.classList.remove(\"active\");\n        }\n    });\n\n    // Update visible section\n    document.querySelectorAll(\".dashboard-section\").forEach(sec => {\n        if (sec.id === `section-${sectionId}`) {\n            sec.classList.add(\"active\");\n        } else {\n            sec.classList.remove(\"active\");\n        }\n    });\n\n    // Load data specific to this section\n    switch (sectionId) {\n        case \"overview\":\n            loadOverview();\n            break;\n        case \"patients\":\n            loadPatients();\n            break;\n        case \"queue\":\n            loadQueue();\n            break;\n        case \"prediction\":\n            // Ready for lookup\n            break;\n        case \"doctors\":\n            loadDoctors();\n            break;\n        case \"forecast\":\n            loadResourceForecast();\n            break;\n        case \"beds\":\n            loadBeds();\n            break;\n        case \"disease\":\n            loadDiseaseTrends();\n            break;\n        case \"inventory\":\n            loadInventory();\n            break;\n        case \"recommendations\":\n            loadRecommendations();\n            break;\n        case \"insights\":\n            loadInsights();\n            break;\n        case \"simulation\":\n            loadSimulationControls();\n            break;\n        case \"ml-performance\":\n            loadMLPerformance();\n            break;\n        case \"about\":\n            // Static guide\n            break;\n    }\n}\n\n// Clock updates\nfunction updateClock() {\n    const el = document.getElementById(\"live-clock\");\n    if (el) {\n        const now = new Date();\n        el.textContent = now.toLocaleTimeString([], { hour: '2-digit', minute: '2-digit', second: '2-digit' });\n    }\n}\n\n// ---------------------------------------------------------------------\n// 1. OVERVIEW MODULE\n// ---------------------------------------------------------------------\nasync function loadOverview() {\n    try {\n        const res = await fetch(\"/api/overview\");\n        const data = await res.json();\n        OracleState.overviewData = data;\n\n        // KPI Counts\n        document.getElementById(\"kpiTotalPatients\").textContent = data.total_registered;\n        document.getElementById(\"kpiWaitingPatients\").textContent = data.waiting_patients;\n        document.getElementById(\"kpiInConsultation\").textContent = data.in_consultation;\n        document.getElementById(\"kpiAvgWaitTime\").textContent = `${data.avg_predicted_wait_time}m`;\n        document.getElementById(\"kpiDoctorsRatio\").textContent = `${data.available_doctors} / ${data.available_doctors + data.busy_doctors}`;\n        document.getElementById(\"kpiBedOccupancy\").textContent = `${data.overall_occupancy_rate}%`;\n\n        // Overcrowding alerts\n        const alertBox = document.getElementById(\"overviewAlertsBanner\");\n        if (alertBox) {\n            let alertHtml = \"\";\n            if (data.overcrowded_departments.length > 0) {\n                alertHtml += `<div class=\"alert alert-warning py-2 mb-2 d-flex align-items-center gap-2\">\n                    <i class=\"fas fa-exclamation-triangle\"></i>\n                    <span><strong>High OPD Traffic:</strong> ${data.overcrowded_departments.join(\", \")} experiencing bottleneck patient volume.</span>\n                </div>`;\n            }\n            if (data.predicted_shortages.length > 0) {\n                alertHtml += `<div class=\"alert alert-danger py-2 mb-2 d-flex align-items-center gap-2\">\n     